                            {
                                "example_id": "093be3ce-f98d-4773-9722-e0f883c870b4",
                                "sense_id": "827b9902-6acd-301a-8cf2-fcaebc32c443",
                                "text": "— Краса́вчика (э́то была́ ло́шадь, ле́вая дышлова́я, приведённая из дере́вни) перекова́ли, а всё хрома́ет, — сказа́л он. — Как прика́жете?",
                                "translation": "\"Beauty\" (that was the left shaft-horse brought up from the country) \"has been badly shod and is quite lame,\" he said. \"What does your honor wish to be done?\"",
                                "english": "\"Beauty\" (that was the left shaft-horse brought up from the country) \"has been badly shod and is quite lame,\" he said. \"What does your honor wish to be done?\""
                            }
                        ]
